WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.650
Running time counts the milliseconds since the micro:bit switched on.

2
00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:08.701
Store it as start, at the moment the heart appears.

3
00:00:09.553 --> 00:00:13.803
At the press, running time minus start is your reaction time.

4
00:00:16.496 --> 00:00:20.921
waiting catches early presses, and best keeps your fastest time.
